      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>CAELNOR — level 3 PC pregen, Aelrathil sun-elf lightweaver, slave escapee. Light-starved by captivity; one flare of the sun-gift left.</p><p><strong>Spellcasting (CHA, caster level 3, 2× 1st-level slots):</strong> Sacred Flame, Light, Guiding Bolt, Healing Word — attached and automated.</p><p><strong>Manual:</strong> Fey Ancestry — advantage on saves vs. being charmed, magic can't put him to sleep.</p>"
      },
      "spellLevel": 3
    },
